        365.2417907714844,
        516.5306396484375,
        379.3298034667969
      ],
      "text": "Should LC-aNAATs on pleural tissue be used to diagnose pleural TB in adults and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        379.6418151855469,
        449.237060546875,
        393.7298278808594
      ],
      "text": "adolescents with signs and symptoms of pleural TB, against an MRS?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        404.3966979980469,
        526.9369506835938,
        417.5417175292969
      ],
      "text": "From two Xpert Ultra studies (105 participants), LC-aNAAT sensitivities were 80% and 100%,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        419.8966979980469,
        527.0262451171875,
        433.0417175292969
      ],
      "text": "and specificities were 75% and 86% ( ); the certainty of evidence was low for sensitivity  Fig. 2.1.5",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.951844215393066,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        435.3966979980469,
        527.12060546875,
        448.5417175292969
      ],
      "text": "and very low for specificity. Only data on Xpert Ultra were included in the evaluation to answer",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.982786178588867,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        450.8966979980469,
        524.7249755859375,
        464.0417175292969
      ],
      "text": "this PICO question, as data on Truenat were not available. Given known challenges with culture-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.949785232543945,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        466.3966979980469,
        526.9173583984375,
        479.5417175292969
      ],
      "text": "based confirmation of TB using this sample, the data using the CRS were also considered.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        481.8966979980469,
        526.9635009765625,
        495.0417175292969
      ],
      "text": "The use of the CRS increased specificity of the LC-aNAAT on pleural tissue to 94–97%, but it",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        497.37738037109375,
        343.2181091308594,
        510.5417175292969
      ],
      "text": "6 decreased sensitivity to 54–81%  (see  ). Web Annex B.3",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
